6", "claim_e20398c7f198070ccede8c3a"], "query_ids": ["q_14"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_aee9d189334d62ef6333c006", "quote": "The week before the 2 April tariff announcement, Hyundai committed to a $21 billion investment through 2028 in the US. This included a new $7.6 billion Metaplant in Georgia, targeting 1.2 million annual units and 100,000 jobs and included vertical integration and localisation of steel, batteries and vehicle production.", "url": "https://www.automotivelogistics.media/supply-chain/automotive-logistics-and-supply-chains-in-2025-tariff-turmoil-investment-uncertainty-and-further-cost-pressures/649740", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai", "facility": "Metaplant in Georgia", "tariff_program": "Trump tariff announcements"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_e20398c7f198070ccede8c3a", "quote": "Hyundai stated that their $21 billion investment will only create 14,000 direct full-time jobs by 2028 with over 100,000 total direct and indirect job opportunities anticipated across manufacturing, technology and infrastructure", "url": "https://www.automotivelogistics.media/supply-chain/automotive-logistics-and-supply-chains-in-2025-tariff-turmoil-investment-uncertainty-and-further-cost-pressures/649740", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_e2a602fbef207ad5e777df62", "claim_ids": ["claim_6b1f78583b25a579ac5b46db", "claim_bac0e286215f32b459973683"], "query_ids": ["q_14"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_6b1f78583b25a579ac5b46db", "quote": "From 3 April 2025, 25% tariffs on all vehicle imports – except for Canada and Mexico, where USMCA compliant parts and vehicles will remain exempt.", "url": "https://www.automotivelogistics.media/supply-chain/automotive-logistics-and-supply-chains-in-2025-tariff-turmoil-investment-uncertainty-and-further-cost-pressures/649740", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"effective_date": "3 April 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_bac0e286215f32b459973683", "quote": "On 9 April 2025, President Trump caved in to pressure from the stock and bond markets and reneged on his widely derided tariff policy.", "url": "https://www.automotivelogistics.media/supply-chain/automotive-logistics-and-supply-chains-in-2025-tariff-turmoil-investment-uncertainty-and-further-cost-pressures/649740", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"announcement_date": "9 April 2025", "reported_policy_status": "reneged on his widely derided tariff policy"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_7aa1217e3fa145a0eb7f432a", "claim_ids": ["claim_04bc8e24cf5f1d98dc062615", "claim_3e4cc3cf1179211f96d30fba"], "query_ids": ["q_140"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_04bc8e24cf5f1d98dc062615", "quote": "April 2025: De minimis exemptions are removed for packages under $800 from China, raising duties to 90%.", "url": "https://manlybattery.com/battery-tariffs", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "De minimis exemptions are removed", "duty_rate": "90%", "effective_date": "April 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_3e4cc3cf1179211f96d30fba", "quote": "Starting in 2025, new Chinese tariffs on imported lithium-ion cells and components—especially those used in energy storage systems—have reached levels as high as 104%, according to updated trade filings.", "url": "https://manlybattery.com/battery-tariffs", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "new Chinese tariffs", "effective_date": "2025"}}]}]}

